  "published": "2026-11-16T17:17:14.08Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.4 - Depends on SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.10 (was 3.0.5): WebAuthn JSON converters, trimmed apps about 630 KB smaller (a narrower trim descriptor) and the 3.0.6 - 3.0.8 fixes (see SpawnDev.SpawnJS's CHANGELOG). An app that got SpawnJS only through this package stayed on 3.0.5. No change of its own. v2.2.1 - @on{event}:preventDefault and :stopPropagation work (they were written into the DOM and did nothing); typed event args for every Blazor event family (pointer, wheel, touch, drag + DataTransfer, clipboard, progress, error - those handlers used to get EventArgs.Empty and never ran); MouseEventArgs.Detail / MovementX/Y. On SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.2.",
